## Conclusion

This project demonstrates how Microsoft Excel can be used to convert raw e-commerce transaction data into a structured analytical dashboard. The dashboard provides a consolidated view of sales, customers, products, payment methods, quantities, and order statuses, making it easier to identify trends and understand overall business performance.

